<title>ESTONIA: PENNU Q1 TURNOVER 42.7 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>PENNU Q1 TURNOVER 42.7 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennu Computer Technology net turnover was 42.7 million kroons in the first quarter compared to 21.7 million kroons in the same period last year, company said on Friday.</p>
<p>Exports made up 7.2 million kroons of the total turnover, compared to 200,000 kroons in the same period last year, the company added in its statement.</p>
<p>Total turnover grew by 96 percent and exports by 3,500 percent, it said.</p>
<p>Pennu said it will publish its profit figures on Friday evening or Monday.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
